Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 21:30:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 0946/3799] soh: rename func_809AABF0 ->
 EffectSsKiraKira_UpdateDrifting

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the updateMode 0 update: random XZ acceleration, alpha ping-ponged by rAlphaStep, and rYaw advanced by rRotSpeed. No velocity damping, unlike the other mode.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/effects/ovl_Effect_Ss_KiraKira/z_eff_ss_kirakira.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 .../effects/ovl_Effect_Ss_KiraKira/z_eff_ss_kirakira.c     | 7 ++++---
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/effects/ovl_Effect_Ss_KiraKira/z_eff_ss_kirakira.c b/soh/src/overlays/effects/ovl_Effect_Ss_KiraKira/z_eff_ss_kirakira.c
index 83b412a07..449ee2d0e 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/effects/ovl_Effect_Ss_KiraKira/z_eff_ss_kirakira.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/effects/ovl_Effect_Ss_KiraKira/z_eff_ss_kirakira.c
@@ -23,7 +23,8 @@
 
 u32 EffectSsKiraKira_Init(PlayState* play, u32 index, EffectSs* this, void* initParamsx);
 void EffectSsKiraKira_Draw(PlayState* play, u32 index, EffectSs* this);
-void func_809AABF0(PlayState* play, u32 index, EffectSs* this);
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_809AABF0: the updateMode 0 update: random XZ acceleration, alpha ping-ponged by rAlphaStep, and rYaw advanced by rRotSpeed. No velocity damping, unlike the other mode.
+void EffectSsKiraKira_UpdateDrifting(PlayState* play, u32 index, EffectSs* this);  // was func_809AABF0 [LLM:HIGH]
 void func_809AACAC(PlayState* play, u32 index, EffectSs* this);
 void func_809AAD6C(PlayState* play, u32 index, EffectSs* this);
 
@@ -49,7 +50,7 @@ u32 EffectSsKiraKira_Init(PlayState* play, u32 index, EffectSs* this, void* init
         this->gfx = SEGMENTED_TO_VIRTUAL(gEffSparklesDL);
 
         if (initParams->updateMode == 0) {
-            this->update = func_809AABF0;
+            this->update = EffectSsKiraKira_UpdateDrifting;  // was func_809AABF0 [LLM:HIGH]
         } else {
             this->update = func_809AACAC;
         }
@@ -113,7 +114,7 @@ void EffectSsKiraKira_Draw(PlayState* play, u32 index, EffectSs* this) {
     CLOSE_DISPS(gfxCtx);
 }
 
-void func_809AABF0(PlayState* play, u32 index, EffectSs* this) {
+void EffectSsKiraKira_UpdateDrifting(PlayState* play, u32 index, EffectSs* this) {
     this->accel.x = (Rand_ZeroOne() * 0.4f) - 0.2f;
     this->accel.z = (Rand_ZeroOne() * 0.4f) - 0.2f;
     this->rEnvColorA += this->rAlphaStep;
